            Stripe Fee Calculator
          </h2>

          <p>
            Online businesses, freelancers, and creators often
            accept payments through payment processors. The amount
            a customer pays may not be identical to the amount
            received after applicable processing costs.
          </p>

          <p>
            The
            <a
              href="https://www.tekzo.tech/tools/stripe-fee-calculator"
            >
              Stripe Fee Calculator
            </a>
            helps you estimate potential payment processing costs
            and understand the amount that may remain from a
            transaction.
          </p>

          <p>
            It can be useful when you're pricing a service,
            sending an invoice, checking a transaction, or
            comparing different payment amounts.
          </p>

          <h3>
            Who can use it?
          </h3>

          <ul>
            <li>Freelancers accepting payments</li>
            <li>Small online businesses</li>
            <li>SaaS businesses</li>
            <li>Digital product sellers</li>
            <li>Online service providers</li>
            <li>Creators selling products or services</li>
